&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;인증서는 만료될 때까지 목록에 남아 있습니다. 만료된 인증서는 나열되지 않아도 어디서나
거부됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="who-reads-them"&gt;누가 읽는가&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="who-reads-them"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#who-reads-them" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;일반 &lt;code&gt;sshd&lt;/code&gt;, 또는 nginx와 다른 TLS 서버:&lt;a href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.6/ko/authn-revokd/"&gt;authn-revokd&lt;/a&gt;가 목록을 가져와 검증되는
것만 보관하고, 서버가 읽는 곳에 기록하며, 목록이 만료되면 sshd에 대해 실패 시
차단합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://go-fileshare.github.io/docs/latest/security/revocation-lists/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;go-fileshare&lt;/a&gt;는
목록을 스스로 가져와 검증하며, 현재 목록이 없는 동안에는 공급자의 인증서를
거부합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="shared-signals"&gt;Shared Signals&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="shared-signals"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#shared-signals" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;액세스 토큰이나 opkssh 인증서는 사용되는 곳에서 확인되며, 어떤 목록도 이를 지명할
수 없습니다. 그래서 공급자는 OpenID Shared Signals 송신기입니다. &lt;code&gt;DisablePerson&lt;/code&gt;,&lt;code&gt;RevokePerson&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;DisableIdP&lt;/code&gt; 때, 요청한 모든 수신기를 위해 CAEP&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;session-revoked&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; 이벤트(이벤트 시각 이전에 이 주체에게 발급된 모든 것이
무효)를 큐에 넣습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-hcl" data-lang="hcl"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;state&lt;/span&gt; { &lt;span class="p"&gt;...&lt;/span&gt; }&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # required: a queue a restart empties loses revocations
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;ssf {} # event_retention&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;192h&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;by&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;default&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;client&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;fileshare-ssf&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; {&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # a receiver: client credentials, scope ssf
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; secret_file&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;/etc/authn-bridge/fileshare-ssf.secret&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; ssf_receiver&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kt"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; audience&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;fileshare&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;$ curl -s http://127.0.0.1:28473/.well-known/ssf-configuration | jq .
{
&amp;#34;issuer&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;http://127.0.0.1:28473&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;jwks_uri&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;http://127.0.0.1:28473/jwks&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;delivery_methods_supported&amp;#34;: [
&amp;#34;urn:ietf:rfc:8936&amp;#34;
],
&amp;#34;configuration_endpoint&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;http://127.0.0.1:28473/ssf/streams&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;status_endpoint&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;http://127.0.0.1:28473/ssf/streams/status&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;add_subject_endpoint&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;http://127.0.0.1:28473/ssf/streams/subjects:add&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;remove_subject_endpoint&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;http://127.0.0.1:28473/ssf/streams/subjects:remove&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;verification_endpoint&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;http://127.0.0.1:28473/ssf/streams/verify&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;spec_version&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;1_0&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;authorization_schemes&amp;#34;: [
{
&amp;#34;spec_urn&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;urn:ietf:rfc:6749&amp;#34;
}
]
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;폴링 전달만&lt;/strong&gt; (RFC 8936): 수신기가 요청하며, 여기서 밖으로 연결하는 것은
없습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;수신기는 비밀 값이 있는 &lt;code&gt;ssf_receiver&lt;/code&gt; 클라이언트의 &lt;strong&gt;클라이언트 자격 증명&lt;/strong&gt;
그랜트로 얻은 &lt;code&gt;ssf&lt;/code&gt; 스코프의 액세스 토큰으로 인증합니다. 자신의 스트림만 볼 수
있고, 최대 열 개입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;이벤트는 ID 토큰 키로 서명한 SET(RFC 8417)이며 &lt;code&gt;exp&lt;/code&gt;도 &lt;code&gt;sub&lt;/code&gt;도 없습니다. 주체는
기본적으로 &lt;strong&gt;계정&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;code&gt;acct:&amp;lt;username&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;입니다. &lt;code&gt;sub&lt;/code&gt;는 클라이언트마다 하나인
pairwise일 수 있기 때문입니다. &lt;code&gt;ssf_subject_format = &amp;quot;iss_sub&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt;로 구성된 수신기는
대신 발급자와 공개 &lt;code&gt;sub&lt;/code&gt;를 받습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;비활성화된 기관은 그곳에서 공급자가 흔적을 가진 사람마다 하나의 이벤트이며,주체가 &lt;strong&gt;테넌트&lt;/strong&gt;, 즉 기관의 엔티티 ID인 이벤트가 하나 있어 스코프와 함께 공급자가
잊어버린 사람들까지 포함합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;스트림과 전달되지 않은 이벤트는 확인응답되거나 &lt;code&gt;event_retention&lt;/code&gt;이 지날 때까지&lt;code&gt;state&lt;/code&gt; 데이터베이스에 보관됩니다. 수신기가 오류로 보고한 이벤트는 최대 열 번까지
다시 전달됩니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SSF 블록은 &lt;code&gt;state&lt;/code&gt; 블록이 없으면 거부됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
